<title>USA: Data Systems gets $2 million contract.</title>
<headline>Data Systems gets $2 million contract.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGTON HILLS, Mich. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data Systems Network Corp said on Friday it was awarded a one-year network integration contract that it estimated will bring in $2 million worth of revenues.</p>
<p>Data Systems did not identify the buyer, saying a large financial institution in the eastern United States signed the contract with its Information Decisions Solutions division.</p>
<p>Data Systems, which provides value-added computer network services and products, said revenues from the contract have already begun to be realized for the fourth quarter.</p>
</text>
